/P 82 0 R
/T (Through the SDC Phase 1 workshop, we learned how to quickly create and test apps using an online workspace. I gained hands-on experience using Replit to speed up writing code, fix mistakes, and build working web tools in a short time. I also learned how to easily launch these projects online so others can use them right away without needing to install complicated software on my computer.)
/E (Through the SDC Phase 1 workshop, we learned how to quickly create and test apps using an online workspace. I gained hands-on experience using Replit to speed up writing code, fix mistakes, and build working web tools in a short time. I also learned how to easily launch these projects online so others can use them right away without needing to install complicated software on my computer.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
