/Title (Skilytics is an AI-powered career guidance and reskilling platform that helps workers stay relevant by aligning their current skills with planned upskilling and reskilling to meet real job market demands. The platform uses a step-by-step AI-powered workflow that automatically extracts skills from uploaded CVs, runs a Holland Code \(RIASEC\) interest test, and compares user profiles against standardized O*NET job requirements. Specialized AI agents then evaluate how exposed a user's current role is to AI knowledge, identify specific skill gaps in the local market, and generate a personalised learning plan matched to trusted courses.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 311 0 R
/Next 583 0 R
>>
